Error [E-OSTARGET-BUILD-CONTEXT]: a `#Known if … == { … }` dispatch branches on `build.os`
  --> tests/ui/os_target_build_context.jet:2:21
    |
  2 |     #Known if build.arch == {
    |                     ^^^^
 Why: `build.os` is the one compiler-known value this dispatch folds on — it selects the arm matching the build's target OS at compile time (D-OSTARGET2)
 Fix: write `#Known if build.os == { .Linux -> … .MacOS -> … .Windows -> … }`, or use a plain runtime `if` for a value that isn't known at compile time
